{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22317","headline":"翰林院中感秋怀王质夫 · 白居易","name":"翰林院中感秋怀王质夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何处感时节，新蝉禁中闻。\n宫槐有秋意，风夕花纷纷。\n寄迹鸳鹭行，归心鸥鹤羣。\n唯有王居士，知予忆白云。\n何日仙游寺，潭前秋见君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22317.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22317","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}